"Dumbbell Lateral Raise":"Stand with dumbbells at sides. Raise arms out to sides until parallel with ground. Slight bend in elbows. Lower with control. Don't shrug.",
"Dumbbell Bicep Curl":"Stand with dumbbells at sides, palms forward. Curl to shoulders, squeeze biceps at top. Lower with control. Can alternate arms or do both simultaneously.",
"Dumbbell Hammer Curl":"Like bicep curl but palms face each other throughout. Targets brachialis and forearms in addition to biceps.",
"Dumbbell Tricep Extension":"Hold one dumbbell overhead with both hands. Lower behind head by bending elbows. Extend back to start. Keep upper arms close to ears.",
"Dumbbell RDL":"Hold dumbbells in front of thighs. Hinge at hips, push butt back, slight knee bend. Lower until hamstring stretch. Drive hips forward to stand.",
