"Straddle Fold":"Seated with legs wide. Fold forward from hips. Stretches adductors and hamstrings. Keep back as flat as possible.",
"Half Split":"From low lunge, shift hips back and straighten front leg. Fold over front leg. Targeted hamstring stretch. Also called runner's stretch.",
