"Eagle Arms":"Cross arms at elbows, wrap forearms, press palms together. Lift elbows. Stretches between shoulder blades. From eagle pose.",
"Mermaid Stretch":"Seated with legs folded to one side. Reach opposite arm overhead, bending laterally. Deep side body stretch. Beautiful Pilates movement.",
"Supine Twist":"Lie on back. Pull one knee across body toward floor. Arms out in T. Look opposite direction. Spinal rotation and stretch.",
"Reclined Butterfly":"Lie on back, soles of feet together, knees open. Arms relaxed. Restorative hip opener and inner thigh stretch.",
"Happy Baby":"Lie on back. Grab outsides of feet, pull knees toward armpits. Gentle rocking. Opens hips, stretches inner thighs.",
