"Shoulder Rolls":"Roll shoulders forward, up, back, and down in large circles. Relieves shoulder tension. Reverse direction.",
"Sun Salutation A":"Standing: fold forward, halfway lift, step/jump back to plank, lower, upward dog, downward dog, step forward, fold, rise. Classical yoga sequence.",
"Sun Salutation B":"Like Sun A but adds chair pose and warrior I. More vigorous than Sun A. Core yoga warm-up sequence.",

